Scope: 7–14 calendar days, planning only. No live-worktree edits, deployment, publication, or external outreach before the clean isolated-worktree gates pass.

## Operating constraints

- Canonical runtime: `/home/sikmindz/Coding/agent-graph-mcp-release` at `ba9fba16c6093e5410f2f54613fb254dc5819248`.
