| 4. Criterion adjudication | Explicit acceptance/denial scoring and fail-closed behavior | 1–2 days |
| 5. Full execution | Baseline/candidate run, comparator, rerun | 1–2 days |
| 6. Failure/security testing | Malformed, missing, denial, replay, boundary tests | 1–2 days |
| 7. Cleanup/reproducibility | Docs, release checks, independent checkout rerun | 1–2 days |
