Stop if an outsider cannot determine:

- what was run;
- against which inputs;
- with which runtime and evaluator;
- how each criterion was decided;
- how to rerun it;
- why the comparator produced its result.

## Phase 6 — failure and security testing

Use existing Rust integration-test patterns and add evaluator-focused tests under the selected `evaluation/tests/` location.

